WEBVTT

00:07:27.193 --> 00:07:30.488
and with investments
in data and technology,

00:07:30.488 --> 00:07:33.032
our audacious vision
is to reach one million farmers

00:07:33.073 --> 00:07:34.617
in the next five years.

00:07:35.075 --> 00:07:40.498
(Cheers and applause)

00:07:40.539 --> 00:07:43.542
We believe we can harness
the power of farmers' own savings

00:07:43.584 --> 00:07:47.129
to greatly reduce poverty
and hunger in West Africa.

00:07:47.171 --> 00:07:49.715
Now is the time
to use a savings-led approach

00:07:49.757 --> 00:07:51.467
to ending poverty for farmers.

00:07:51.509 --> 00:07:52.676
Thank you.

00:07:52.718 --> 00:07:58.140
(Cheers and applause)